</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 513)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>DWA-compressed EXRs open.</b> Renders compressed with DWAA/DWAB — the format most comps arrive in — now load and play like any other EXR. Previously they refused with "Could not decode" even though the files were fine.</li>
<li><b>When a file truly can't be read, the message says why</b> — "deep EXR — not supported", "possibly truncated" — instead of leaving you guessing whether the delivery is broken.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
